Package: projecttools
Title: Tools for Initialising and Conducting Research Projects
Version: 1.1.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Ross",
           family = "Wilson",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ross.wilson@otago.ac.nz")
Description: The `projecttools` ecosystem is a set of packages to assist in data
    analysis for research projects, primarily for my work at
    [CMOR](https://uo-cmor.github.io). This umbrella package makes it easy
    to install and load these packages. These are all forked from the former
    `uo-cmor/cmor.tools`, which is no longer maintained.
